Q1. Approve native constructor refinement (pinning in Python, config JSON, exact reward dict, explicit hire_limit), observe without seed consumption, and six transition outputs also on reset (truncate leaves them untouched, R1). If changed, update both briefs and full stub together; accepted contract edits require review.

